@startuml state
' State machine diagram. Rules: chapter 16 §8.
!include _treklink-style.puml
hide empty description
title stm Rental contract (excerpt)

[*] --> REQUESTED : Org Manager submitted request
REQUESTED --> APPROVED : Staff approved [units available] / reserve devices
REQUESTED --> REJECTED : Staff rejected / record reason
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : contract cancelled before handover / release devices
APPROVED --> ACTIVE : handover signed [first payment recorded]
ACTIVE --> RETURN_DUE : term ended
RETURN_DUE --> RETURNED : last device checked in
RETURNED --> CLOSED : balance settled [no open incident]
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]
@enduml
